    "  `ServerPacket.ComponentHolding`, ported as `ComponentHoldingServerPacket`",
    "  (`super::super::server_packet`).",
    "",
    "Java's serializer is not a template: it writes the value/type/number-format",
    "triple only for modes 0 and 2, so the port keeps that branch."
  ],
